{"title":"2006 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 15","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Suppose <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/c/95c6d0453dd9438d52267937c0742af65c5e0ccc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos x=0$\" width=\"70\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/2/3026b28b8ab79344a1de2554c78e44bf3be55133.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos (x+z)=1/2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"131\" height=\"18\" />. What is the smallest possible positive value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/4/dd48cfdb542a30eb0130e6282364ebac5efd8a4d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A) \\ } \\frac{\\pi}{6}\\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ } \\frac{\\pi}{3}\\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\ } \\frac{\\pi}{2}\\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\ } \\frac{5\\pi}{6} \\quad \\mathrm{(E) \\ } \\frac{7\\pi}{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"372\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/b/e8b5e42382dc69750f3a649ca44f9ddcec1ef6c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos x = 0$\" width=\"70\" height=\"12\" />, x must be in the form of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/3/373b9daf50d39fe915ef332c968a190b29276c0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\pi}{2} + \\pi n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"58\" height=\"33\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> denotes any <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Integer\" title=\"Integer\">integer</a>.</li>\n<li>For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/3/763b92f23f7ba2744eefc7896026f7fd0a75d022.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos (x+z) = 1 / 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"131\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/f/37fedd041985400f4d214e2f0f464d75d7ecec11.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + z = \\frac{\\pi}{3} +2\\pi n, \\frac{5\\pi}{3} + 2\\pi n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"219\" height=\"37\" />.</li></ul>\n<p>The smallest possible value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> will be that of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/4/5f44352075ec0ab1a02f183eba9a3bf256085852.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{5\\pi}{3} - \\frac{3\\pi}{2} = \\frac{\\pi}{6} \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{(A)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"164\" height=\"37\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Notice that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/8/3083cafbe5dae2b519b5bc5a5502731547e2038c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos (x+z) = \\cos x \\cos z - \\sin x \\sin z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"279\" height=\"20\" />, we will obtain <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/e/fce7c948e3306fcb41845e5e08d306b478e18333.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos (x+z) = - \\sin x \\sin z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"197\" height=\"20\" /> after plugging <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/b/e8b5e42382dc69750f3a649ca44f9ddcec1ef6c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos x = 0$\" width=\"70\" height=\"12\" />. Knowing that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/a/48a9ac6e803eb401eab4f233c62e46fd6502f4a6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos (x+z) = \\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"120\" height=\"38\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/9/ab973481a4d0479abe699f65923fcd87a562b941.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin x \\sin z = - \\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"127\" height=\"38\" />. \n</p><p>Now we can try plugging the answer choices back in to see if each works: \n</p><p>When <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/0/b101425592a5b091b5c7f6853f780eb1566c8113.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z = \\frac{\\pi}{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"50\" height=\"34\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/d/6ed8ce7d309c683a7efba8f38423fc31fdf77161.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin z = \\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"74\" height=\"38\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/1/711234bc4016c6f0ad5da70459101827d898db5a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin x = - 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"85\" height=\"15\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/8/6e8f3a072de64627a11a2df663e577eb43d60c77.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin x$\" width=\"35\" height=\"12\" /> is obtainable when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/3/92303f888e59880fbc04cd2e82d1302d7c421f6c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{3\\pi}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"61\" height=\"38\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/0/b101425592a5b091b5c7f6853f780eb1566c8113.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z = \\frac{\\pi}{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"50\" height=\"34\" /> works. \n</p><p>The question asks for the smallest positive value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/8/a98a590d3c0cd84e8480bdf28c2d2287f793b540.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\pi}{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"17\" height=\"34\" /> is the smallest among the choices. Thus, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/6/366ab3e339a5f3a6b2a2b974562535e7301e446d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A) } \\frac{\\pi}{6}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"64\" height=\"46\" />\n</p><p>~<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/User:Andy_li0805\">Andy_li0805</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2006 AMC 12A Problems\">2006 AMC 12A Problems</a></li></ul>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A\" title=\"2006 AMC 12A\">2006 AMC 12A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2006 AMC 12A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2006 AMC 12A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2006 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 14\">Problem 14</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2006 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 16\">Problem 16</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2006 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2006 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/i